WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.280
Fired On, from 1907.

2
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:06.420
Cavalry soldiers at a stream
at night are suddenly under fire.

3
00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:11.190
A white horse rears in the moonlight,
and you never see who is shooting.

4
00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:16.080
Remington returned to this moment again
and again: the white soldier in danger,

5
00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:17.470
surrounded, tested.

6
00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:20.790
This painting comes
after the Spanish-American War,

7
00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:25.110
yet its logic is identical
to his frontier work of the 1880s.

8
00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:28.670
The enemy has changed.
The visual grammar has not.
